# The tools in this repo edit source by matching exact text spans, so a
# checkout that rewrites line endings silently breaks them: three rows of the
# reduction menu started failing with "not found in hud.js" after one
# git checkout turned four files CRLF.
*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
